flowchart TB
  Compose[Docker Compose] --> Health[Actuator healthchecks]
  Health --> Restart[restart: unless-stopped]
  Compose --> Logs[Service logs + correlation-id]
  DB[(PostgreSQL)] --> Backup[Daily backup job]
  Backup --> Keep[Keep 7 copies]
  Webhook[Payment webhook failure] --> Manual[Manual reconciliation by Manager/Admin]
  Manual --> Audit[Audit log]
  Backup --> Restore[Documented restore procedure]
  Nginx[Nginx HTTPS] --> Smoke[Smoke test: login / menu / COD / transfer]
